# Realtime AI Interpreter

A voice-translation application designed to help people who speak different languages understand each other. The first MVP focuses on **English → Hindi**: a user records a short message, the backend transcribes it, translates the text, and generates Hindi speech for playback.

> **Project status:** Active development. Sprint 0 established the application foundation. Sprint 1 is building the first usable voice-translation MVP. The architecture and commands below reflect the project plan and implementation notes; verify each feature locally before treating it as release-ready. A public production deployment has not been confirmed in these notes.

